    {
      "id": "e0c0039d-e810-498c-b97b-f501ca71ccaf",
      "type": "callout",
      "position": 16,
      "data": {
        "variant": "success",
        "title": "",
        "content": "Take-aways: Lambda: 128 MB-10 GB, 15 min max, sync (6 MB) / async (256 KB) / poll-based. Cold start mitigável com Provisioned Concurrency / SnapStart / memory. Lambda em VPC precisa NAT/VPC Endpoint para AWS services. API GW: REST (features completas) vs HTTP (barato e rápido) vs WebSocket. Step Functions orquestram workflows (Standard longo, Express curto). EventBridge roteia eventos por pattern. SAM/CDK para deploy. Serverless resolve \"menor esforço operacional\" — frase-chave no exame."
      }
    }
